      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">社名</span><span class="about-fact__v">海月舎</span></div>
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">設立</span><span class="about-fact__v">2026年</span></div>
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">代表</span><span class="about-fact__v">山内 悠人</span></div>
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">事業</span><span class="about-fact__v">ウェブマガジン「KURAGE」運営<br>書籍の企画・編集・出版</span></div>
      <div class="about-fact"><span class="about-fact__k">理念</span><span class="about-fact__v">骨のない文章が、いちばん深い。</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
